      "id": "claim_20ceebfb5de04ce8a57dfe88a234cb59",
      "statement": "runs/speedrun.sh is the reference pipeline: it downloads 8 shards, starts a 170-shard download in the background, trains and evaluates the tokenizer, waits for the download, pretrains d24 with --target-param-data-ratio=8 --fp8 on 8 GPUs via torchrun, runs base_eval, chat_sft and chat_eval, and defaults WANDB_RUN to dummy which disables wandb.",
      "evidence": [
